# What the dependences of this file have to come out as.
#
# The members differ in element size, so the index is scaled onto the
# canonical member: the read of g->h[2048] and the write of g->f[1024]
# are the same two bytes.  Without the walk through subscripts the union
# machinery is missed and this comes back empty.
dep_false *: \{ S_1\[\] -> S_2\[[a-z_0-9]+\] : [a-z_0-9]+ = 2048 \}
